  "notes": [
    "The author's ca13ed8 is timhastie/octatrick-modules main and tag v2.12 (pushed 11 October 2026). From 5f3d745 (v2.11) it changes, for this module, synth/poly.s (po_stop and its detour removed: the metronome fix), synth/machine.s (ml_reset: a machine change to or from FM SYNTH / SY DRUM resets the track's machine parameters to init; step and scene locks kept, as in stock), synth/manifest.py (the po_stop detour removed, the po_unload detour added), synth/engine_abi.inc (a comment) and synth/README.md. synth/page.s and quantizer/ are unchanged from v2.11. The author's direct-jump, tuner and processor-load modules are untouched; this package does not carry them.",
    "0.1.3-experimental was a local, unsubmitted draft of the 2.10 line; 0.1.4-experimental was first drafted on v2.11 (5f3d745, record synth-5f3d745.json, replaced by this one) and is still unpublished, so the version stays 0.1.4-experimental. The published version before 0.1.4 is 0.1.2-experimental."
